Issue title: [InstCombine] fcmp is incorrectly inverted
Detailed information:
Source:
define float @test_select_nnan_nsz_fcmp_olt(float %x) {
  %cmp = fcmp olt float %x, 0.000000e+00
  %sel = select nnan nsz i1 %cmp, float %x, float -0.000000e+00
  ret float %sel
}

Target:
; ModuleID = '<stdin>'
source_filename = "<stdin>"

define float @test_select_nnan_nsz_fcmp_olt(float %x) {
  %.inv = fcmp oge float %x, 0.000000e+00
  %sel1 = select i1 %.inv, float -0.000000e+00, float %x
  ret float %sel1
}

Transformation doesn't verify!

ERROR: Value mismatch

Example:
float %x = #x7f800010 (SNaN)

Source:
i1 %cmp = #x0 (0)
float %sel = #x80000000 (-0.0)

Target:
i1 %.inv = #x0 (0)
float %sel1 = #x7f800010 (SNaN)
Source value: #x80000000 (-0.0)
Target value: #x7f800010 (SNaN)

Summary:
  0 correct transformations
  1 incorrect transformations
  0 failed-to-prove transformations
  0 Alive2 errors

